      "text color" : "[0.11400014907121658, 0.11400014907121658, 0.1289997696876526]",
      "content" : "John is watching a football match of his favourite team. A foul has been committed and overlay graphics display the distance from the goal line."
    }, {
      "type" : "paragraph",
      "pdfua_tag" : "P",
      "id" : 3,
      "page number" : 1,
