      "font size" : 10.5,
      "text color" : "[0.11400014907121658, 0.11400014907121658, 0.1289997696876526]",
      "content" : "A graphic overlay notifies him that a new bet placement option has become available. Interactive elements on the respective graphics overlays give him the opportunity place a Bet concerning the outcome of the free kick."
    }, {
      "type" : "paragraph",
      "pdfua_tag" : "P",
