      "font size" : 10.5,
      "text color" : "[0.11400014907121658, 0.11400014907121658, 0.1289997696876526]",
      "content" : "He clicks on the statistics label that follows the player to access the available statistics information. He decides to place the bet through the STB remote control. He follows the on-screen instructions and proceeds to place a bet. Upon bet placement and confirmation he receives a notification message that verifies the transaction."
    }, {
      "type" : "paragraph",
